# Dockerfile-specific allowlist: the Python package, contracts examples and the tests it runs.
**
!contracts/
!contracts/capabilities.json
!contracts/examples/
!contracts/examples/**
!src/
!src/radar/
!src/radar/**/*.py
!src/radar/schemas/
!src/radar/schemas/*.json
!tests/
!tests/test_contracts.py
!tests/openrouter/
!tests/openrouter/*.py
!pyproject.toml
!requirements.lock
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
**/__pycache__/
**/.env*
